# Release check for TinyDotnetLib

Dependencies are installed with `dotnet restore` and the tests run with `dotnet test`.
See the [testing guide](https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/testing/) and the [contributing notes](https://github.com/steplet-corpus/TinyDotnetLib/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).

Report the summary line exactly as printed.
